lk","subtitle":"Waterfront trail · Saturday afternoon","notes":"Choose a comfortable out-and-back segment, share the path with other users, and turn around early if weather, footing, or daylight is unsuitable.","short_summary":"Extend the waterfront visit with a flexible pedestrian-and-bicycle trail walk.","evidence_claim":"The City lists the Lakewalk among its paved and gravel trails open to pedestrians and bicyclists.","source_url":"https://duluthmn.gov/parks/trail-pages-list/paved-trails/","source_title":"Paved Trails | City of Duluth, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":46.781296,"longitude":-92.091939,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Trail conditions can change; use the city’s parks and trails information and follow posted guidance.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"leif-erikson-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Leif Erikson Park","title":"Pause at Leif Erikson Park","subtitle":"11th Ave E & London Road · Saturday afternoon","notes":"Walk through the park beside Lake Superior and look for the Rose Garden, historic amphitheater, and the Lakewalk route through the grounds.","short_summary":"A named lakeside park that links garden, trail, and amphitheater features.","evidence_claim":"Leif Erikson Park includes the Duluth Rose Garden, a historic amphitheater stage, and the Lakewalk; the city lists paved trail and beach access among its features.","source_url":"https://duluthmn.gov/parks/parks-trails/parks-listing/leif-erikson-park/","source_title":"Leif Erikson Park | City of Duluth, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":46.799676,"longitude":-92.083072,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is an outdoor city park; use designated paths and observe posted park rules or event-related restrictions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hartley-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Hartley Park","title":"Finish with a Hartley Park trail walk","subtitle":"3001 Woodland Avenue · Sunday daytime","notes":"Pick a short multi-purpose trail, bring appropriate footwear, and leave enough time to return before conditions change; share the trail courteously.","short_summary":"Close the weekend with a nearby wooded trail network and nature-center setting.","evidence_claim":"Hartley Park is a 640-acre park with ten miles of multi-purpose trails through forest and wetlands and is home to Hartley Nature Center.","source_url":"https://duluthmn.gov/parks/parks-trails/parks-listing/hartley-park/","source_title":"Hartley Park | City of Duluth, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":46.841454,"longitude":-92.093513,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The city lists hiking, biking, mountain-bike, cross-country-ski, birding, and public-restroom features; select a route suited to current conditions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
